{"reply_subject":"Re: بشرة حساسة","reply_body":"وعليكم السلام عائشة،

شكرًا لتواصلك معنا. تختلف ملاءمة المنتجات حسب المكونات ومدى تحمّل بشرتك، لذلك لا يمكننا تأكيد أن الغسول أو التونر مناسبين دون معرفة المنتجين. أرسلي لنا اسميهما أو صور المكونات، وسيسعد فريقنا بمساعدتك. وبما أن بشرتك تتحسس بسرعة، يُفضّل اختبار المنتج على منطقة صغيرة أولًا.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Gift card","reply_body":"Hello Hamad,

Thanks for reaching out! We’ll check whether gift cards are available in the 300 AED amount and whether one can be arranged in time for your sister’s birthday on Saturday. Our team will confirm the details with you.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Routine question","reply_body":"Hi Grace,

Vitamin C is commonly used in the morning, followed by sunscreen. Retinol is generally best used at night. To reduce the chance of irritation, consider using them at different times of day rather than layering them, and introduce retinol gradually while following each product’s directions. If you have sensitive skin or experience irritation, pause use and check with a dermatologist.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: لا أستطيع الدخول","reply_body":"مرحبًا ريم،

نأسف لمواجهتك هذه المشكلة. يُرجى التحقق من مجلد الرسائل غير المرغوب فيها والتأكد من إدخال عنوان البريد الإلكتروني المرتبط بحسابك بشكل صحيح. إذا لم تصل رسالة إعادة التعيين، أخبرينا بذلك وسيساعدك فريقنا في التحقق من الأمر.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Help with your discount code","reply_body":"Hi,

Sorry you’re having trouble applying code WELCOME10. Please check that it’s entered exactly as shown and that your items meet any offer requirements. If it still doesn’t work, reply with a screenshot of the checkout error and we’ll look into it.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Add to my order","reply_body":"Hi Huda,

Thanks for reaching out. We’ll check whether the cleanser can be added to your order and confirm what’s possible.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Sunscreen and pregnancy","reply_body":"Hi Emily,

Thanks for checking. Pregnancy can affect which skincare ingredients are suitable, and we can’t confirm whether this sunscreen is safe for you. Please review its ingredient list with your doctor or pharmacist before continuing to use it. If you share the ingredients, our team can help identify them for your healthcare provider to review.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Wrong product received","reply_body":"Hi Fatima,

I’m sorry you received body lotion instead of the night cream you ordered. I understand how disappointing that is. We’ll review order LS-10311 and confirm the next steps with you as soon as possible.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"بخصوص تأخر طلبك","reply_body":"مرحبًا خالد،
نعتذر عن تأخر طلبك وعن صعوبة التواصل معنا. نتفهم انزعاجك، وسنراجع حالة الطلب مع الفريق ونؤكد لك الخيارات المتاحة بخصوص طلبك. يرجى تزويدنا برقم الطلب حتى نتمكن من متابعة الأمر.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Charged twice!!","reply_body":"Hi Ali,

I’m sorry for the concern caused by the two charges for order LS-10421. Our team will review the transactions and confirm the next steps with you. For your security, please don’t send your full card details by email.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: VERY BAD SERVICE","reply_body":"Hello,

We’re sorry for the delay and understand how frustrating it is to be waiting for an update. Please reply with your order number so our team can check the status and follow up with you.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: moisturizer","reply_body":"Hi,

I’m sorry the moisturizer caused pimples. Please stop using it for now, and consult a healthcare professional if the reaction is severe or doesn’t improve. We can review your refund request and confirm the available options. Could you share your order number and the moisturizer’s name?

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}

{"reply_subject":"Re: Third email - refund still missing","reply_body":"Hi Robert,

I’m sorry you’ve had to contact us three times about the refund for your return approved on 2 September. I understand how frustrating this is. I’ve escalated your request to a manager, and our team will review the refund status and confirm the next steps with you.

Lumi Skin Customer Team"}
